}

docs {
  # roster-core.readonly endpoint access (ONEROSTER-55)

  Requests an LEA token holding only the `roster-core.readonly` scope, then checks that:

  - every non-demographics collection endpoint returns HTTP 200
  - `/demographics` returns HTTP 403 in the `imsx_*` error envelope

  The token is stored in `lea-rosterCoreToken`, separate from `lea-odsApiToken`, so
  other folders keep using the full-scope token.
}
